8
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,730
"It was just past dawn
on the prairie,

9
00:00:15,729 --> 00:00:17,159
"and like every morning,

10
00:00:17,164 --> 00:00:19,164
"Amelia prepared
to do her chores.

11
00:00:19,166 --> 00:00:21,996
(Penny:)Except something about
this morning felt different."

12
00:00:22,002 --> 00:00:23,402
(Penny:)Why?

13
00:00:25,539 --> 00:00:28,239
